==English==
[[File:Collared Dove (Streptopelia decaocto), Fairlands Valley Park, Stevenage, 15 April 2011.jpg|thumb|A {{w|Eurasian Collared Dove|Eurasian collared dove}}]]

===Etymology===
From the fact that the species is a [[dove]] with a black [[collar]] around its neck.

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A [[bird]] of the species ''[[Streptopelia decaocto]]''.

